    <summaries>
      <summary>
        <versionCode>00</versionCode>
        <actionDate>2026-08-27</actionDate>
        <actionDesc>Introduced in House</actionDesc>
        <updateDate>2026-08-29T01:22:53Z</updateDate>
        <text><![CDATA[<p>This resolution states that the House of Representatives</p><ul><li>condemns and denounces socialism in all its forms, including the Democratic Socialists of America, and opposes the implementation of socialist policies in the United States;</li><li>reaffirms its support for free, fair, and secure elections and calls for enactment of the SAVE America Act;</li><li>reiterates that American elections are for American citizens only; and</li><li>recommits itself to upholding the U.S. Constitution.</li></ul>]]></text>
      </summary>
    </summaries>
    <title>Providing for the condemnation and denouncement of socialism in all its forms, and for other purposes.</title>
